{% comment %}
  SECTION: Social Proof / Reviews
  Replaces placeholder testimonials on the homepage.
  Add below the hero or price comparison section.

  HOW TO ADD:
  Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Sections → New section (name: pc-reviews)
  Paste this. Add to homepage template via theme editor.

  UPDATE BEFORE PUBLISHING:
  - Replace the three quoted testimonials with real buyer quotes pulled from your Google reviews
  - The "112 reviews" and "4.9 stars" figures match brand.md — update if your count changes
  - The Day 3 buyer quote ("I was really focused on Day 3") is from Luis D., Go Global interview
{% endcomment %}

<section class="pc-reviews" id="reviews">
  <div class="pc-reviews__inner">

    <div class="pc-reviews__header">
      <span class="pc-reviews__eyebrow">What buyers say</span>
      <h2 class="pc-reviews__title">4.9 stars. 112 people.<br>They didn't all get it wrong.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="pc-reviews__grid">

      <div class="pc-review">
        <div class="pc-review__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="pc-review__body">
          "The coffee was rich, smooth, and perfectly flavored — exactly what I needed.
          I love my morning coffee, but by 2pm I crash. This felt smoother."
        </p>
        <div class="pc-review__meta">
          <span class="pc-review__name">Lauriete M.</span>
          <span class="pc-review__tag">Verified buyer</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pc-review">
        <div class="pc-review__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="pc-review__body">
          "Day 1: skeptical. Day 2: still skeptical. Day 3: I was really focused.
          I stopped reaching for a second cup by 10am. That's when I knew something
          was actually different."
        </p>
        <div class="pc-review__meta">
          <span class="pc-review__name">Luis D.</span>
          <span class="pc-review__tag">Verified buyer</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pc-review">
        <div class="pc-review__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="pc-review__body">
          "I added it to my oat milk and it worked perfectly. The ritual makes it easy.
          Energy feels more level — no sudden drop that pushes you toward another cup."
        </p>
        <div class="pc-review__meta">
          <span class="pc-review__name">Luis D.</span>
          <span class="pc-review__tag">Verified buyer</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="pc-reviews__cta-row">
      <a href="/products/power-coffee" class="pc-reviews__cta">
        Try it for $1.26 a morning
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="pc-reviews__all-link">Read all 112 reviews →</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.pc-reviews {
  background: #171412;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  padding: 80px 24px;
  font-family: -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
}

.pc-reviews__inner {
  max-width: 1080px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.pc-reviews__header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.pc-reviews__eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #D9A633;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.pc-reviews__title {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 40px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.15;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  margin: 0;
}

.pc-reviews__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 48px;
}

.pc-review {
  background: #1E1A17;
  border: 1px solid rgba(247,240,224,0.07);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 28px 24px;
}

.pc-review__stars {
  color: #D9A633;
  font-size: 16px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.pc-review__body {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.8);
  margin: 0 0 20px;
  font-style: italic;
}

.pc-review__meta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

.pc-review__name {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #F7F0E0;
}

.pc-review__tag {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #D9A633;
  background: rgba(217,166,51,0.1);
  padding: 3px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.pc-reviews__cta-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 28px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.pc-reviews__cta {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #D9A633;
  color: #171412;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 14px 36px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: opacity 0.18s;
}

.pc-reviews__cta:hover {
  opacity: 0.9;
}

.pc-reviews__all-link {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.5);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: color 0.18s;
}

.pc-reviews__all-link:hover {
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.8);
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .pc-reviews {
    padding: 60px 16px;
  }
  .pc-reviews__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PC Reviews",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
